<article class="env-lemma" id="05EM">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05EM">Lemma <span data-tag="05EM">15.91.12</span>.</a> Assume $\varphi : R \to S$ is a flat ring map and $I = (f_1, \ldots , f_ t) \subset R$ is an ideal such that $R/I \to S/IS$ is an isomorphism. Then the functor $H^0$ is a left quasi-inverse to the functor $\text{Can}$ of Remark <a href="/tag/05EL" data-tag="05EL">15.91.10</a>. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
